      "published": "2026-11-24",
      "version": "0.1.5",
      "notes": "Changes since 0.1.3:\n\n- A game pad already on a powered hub when you start is found, and pads plugged in or pulled out while you play are seen.\n- Hold both fire buttons and * on controller 1 for 2 seconds, or Select and Start on a USB pad, to go back to the menu."
